<!-- Composed SUBMIT-mode grading, authored the long way: a TextSelectionGrader
     wrapping a TextSelectionInput inside a CapaProblem. Make selections, then
     Check. The bare <SimpleTextSelection mode="graded"> tag expands to exactly
     this. Shared with TextSelectionInput's docs via the TextSelectionInputGraded
     symlink. -->
<CapaProblem id="graded_verbs" grade="submit" title="Find the verbs">
  <TextSelectionGrader>
    <TextSelectionInput>
Find the verbs in this paragraph:
---
The dog [runs] quickly. It [barks] at the mailman and [chases] the car.
---
all: Perfect! You found all three verbs.
&gt;1: Good progress! There are more verbs to find.
: Look for action words - what is the dog doing?
    </TextSelectionInput>
  </TextSelectionGrader>
</CapaProblem>
